<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Home Health said started buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Home Health said started buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities began coverage of Home Health Corp with a buy rating on Monday, according to a Prudential source.</p>
<p>-- Home Health shares closed at $12 on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
